  "body": "They've lived here, raised their family here, watched the sun rise over the water, enjoyed long summer evenings on the decks and, after more than three decades, they're finally ready to let someone else fall in love with it.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a home where grandparents, adult children or guests can have genuine independence, where teenagers can disappear into their own world, and where everyone can come together when you want to - all while enjoying an elevated sun-soaked position with stunning sea views - welcome home. \r\n\r\nTucked away down a quiet lane just off Whangaparaoa Road, this is a home that has been loved by its current owners since 1995. They first fell in love with the position. And while Red Beach may have changed a little over the years, those relaxing ocean views, sunrises, sunshine and sunsets haven't.\r\n\r\nSpread across three levels and approximately 300sqm, this substantial home features three bedrooms on the main floor and a separate 1-bedroom granny flat downstairs. This versatile layout offers exceptional flexibility, with the lower-level retreat complete with its own legal kitchen, huge bathroom, and private entrance if required.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is where life happens:\r\n\r\nCharacter-filled and north-facing, the main living level is flooded with sunshine. A spectacular tongue-and-groove vaulted ceiling and large angular windows make the most of the picture perfect outlook.\r\n\r\nThe recently renovated kitchen is a real talking point, with a generous designer island and separate scullery. Ranch sliders open to a covered veranda wrapping around the entire top floor, with additional deck areas for following the sun or finding the shade.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom enjoys its own ensuite and direct deck access, with two further double bedrooms, family bathroom and separate toilet completing this level.\r\n\r\nThen there's the mezzanine - a dream get away for kids or teenagers - plus an adjoining office or imagination land with secret spaces ready for hours of play.\r\n\r\nDownstairs brings another level of possibility:\r\n\r\nAlongside the double internal-access garage, office area and excellent storage is the independent granny accommodation. With its own legal kitchen, huge bathroom, separate entrance and two sliders opening to the deck, it offers genuine privacy for extended family, guests or teenagers.\r\n\r\nIt could also work beautifully for a home-based business - the current owners have even used the kitchen for commercial cake making.\r\n\r\nOutside, there's room for the boat, camper and all the extras that come with family life.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's more land:\r\n\r\nThe adjoining 12 Vista Motu section is also being offered for sale, giving you the rare opportunity to buy the home on its own, or secure both properties for an even more substantial holding. Building covenants are in place for height you can build, so there will still be the great sea views from the deck.\r\n\r\nLife beyond the front gate:\r\n\r\nRed Beach gives you the coastal lifestyle without sacrificing convenience. The beach, Red\r\nBeach School, parks and local amenities are close by, while Orewa offers cafe's, restaurants, shopping and ultimate sea-side recreation. Silverdale is nearby for major retail, services and motorway access, with easy connections north and south.\r\n\r\nAfter 31 years it's time to pass the baton. How will you enjoy this outstanding opportunity?\r\n\r\nCall Paul today",
